@ElloSaude.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5112
@token = replace-with-a-valid-jwt
@appointmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@professionalId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@scheduleBlockId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

GET {{ElloSaude.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Generate a WhatsApp appointment confirmation link
GET {{ElloSaude.Api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/whatsapp-confirmation-link?timeZoneId=America%2FSao_Paulo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### List active schedule blocks overlapping a date range
GET {{ElloSaude.Api_HostAddress}}/api/professionals/blocks?startDateTime=2026-11-01T00%3A00%3A00Z&endDateTime=2026-11-08T00%3A00%3A00Z&professionalId={{professionalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Block a professional's schedule
POST {{ElloSaude.Api_HostAddress}}/api/professionals/{{professionalId}}/blocks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDateTime": "2026-11-02T12:00:00Z",
  "endDateTime": "2026-11-02T13:00:00Z",
  "reason": "Almoço"
}

###

### Cancel a schedule block
DELETE {{ElloSaude.Api_HostAddress}}/api/professionals/{{professionalId}}/blocks/{{scheduleBlockId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Read immutable appointment status history
GET {{ElloSaude.Api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/status-history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
